  "mandatory_rules": [
    "P0 always HUMAN_ESCALATION",
    "No claim of READY/COMPLETE/ACCEPTED without evidence",
    "ETA must be rebaselined when material customer dependency blocks delivery",
    "Fast-track may not bypass QA/security/UAT",
    "Complaint prevention communication must be factual and must not conceal blockers",
    "Financial/refund/security decisions remain human-controlled",
    "No complaint does not equal satisfaction; explicit evidence is required before classifying customer experience as healthy after material milestones",
    "First response SLA and resolution SLA must be tracked separately",
    "Customer must not be required to repeat already-confirmed project information after internal handoff",
    "Post-handover adoption must be observed separately from technical UAT pass",
    "Customer charge may not exceed the human-approved quotation without an approved change request",
    "Deployment is not complete until health check and immutable artifact evidence pass",
    "Builder/model/dependency updates require compatibility and regression evidence before use on customer delivery",
    "Conflicting project/payment/support/delivery states must fail closed and reconcile to an authoritative evidence source",
    "Agent execution must have bounded steps, retries, cost and wall-clock budgets with a kill switch",
    "Agreed portability and exit artifacts must be available before final handover",
    "Internal AI retries, failed builds, hallucinations, regressions and bug fixes may not be charged as extra customer work unless a genuine scope change is human-approved",
    "No single staff account, billing error or authentication failure may be allowed to silently destroy customer runtime continuity",
    "Material project state and decisions must be persisted outside ephemeral chat or session context",
    "Destructive actions require target verification, blast-radius evidence and recoverability before execution",
    "DNS configuration alone is not proof of domain readiness; service-specific verification must pass",
    "Required edit, approve, deploy, billing, admin and acceptance permissions must be verified before kickoff or release",
    "Commercial plan changes require a dated change record and required customer notice",
    "P0/P1 or repeated no-progress support interactions must escalate to a human owner",
    "Consequential retries must be idempotent and deduplicated",
    "Customer business assets must not depend solely on a developer personal account",
    "Required customer export and migration evidence must exist before termination or destructive offboarding"
  ]
